#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wse.rst:58
#: e4fbee4a164a4c068a886e968fa76f4f
msgid "Camera and Supply Switch"
msgstr "摄像头与供电切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wse.rst:60
#: 86c861596b714d9686ce9c41fa6fb1f5
msgid ""
"Switching between the two camera inputs, C1 (default on) or C2, and between "
"on (default) and off of Vsw (jumper selectable selectable supply), can be "
"implemented using the Relay function of ArduPilot and assigning the relays "
"to an ``RCx_OPTION`` switch on the transmitter."
msgstr ""
"可通过 ArduPilot 的继电器功能在两路摄像头输入 C1（默认开启）或 C2 之间切换，以及在 "
"Vsw（跳线可选供电）的开启（默认）与关闭之间切换，并将继电器分配给遥控器上的 ``RCx_OPTION`` 开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wse.rst:62
#: bdaf7a6ddee443f498c65c1ade5783db
msgid ""
"Set the ``RELAYx_PIN`` to \"81\" for on/off of Vsw, and to \"82\" to control"
" the camera switching. Then select an RC channel for control (Chx) and set "
"its ``RCx_OPTION`` to the appropriate Relay (1-4) that you had set its pin "
"parameter above."
msgstr ""
"将 ``RELAYx_PIN`` 设为 「81」用于 Vsw 的开关控制，设为 「82」用于摄像头切换控制。然后选择一个 RC "
"通道（Chx）进行控制，并将其 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设置为上述已设定引脚参数的对应继电器（1-4）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wse.rst:65
#: 315e8e904c254c149e89c9dd4cc3601e
msgid ""
"For example, use Channel 10 to control the camera switch using Relay 2:"
msgstr "例如，使用通道 10 通过继电器 2 控制摄像头切换："

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wse.rst:67
#: ef7f9dd64a1b47ee9c8fa5a4aad3b748
msgid ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = \"82\""
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = 「82」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wse.rst:68
#: e9073f118d2a460b809e5cb41bf09959
msgid ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = \"34\" (Relay2 Control)"
msgstr ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = 「34」（继电器 2 控制）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf765-wse.rst:70
#: 4a454a5ada4941d0874a96d523c3161e
msgid ""
"setting Relay on/high assigned for Vsw will turn off that supply. Likewise, "
"setting on/high for the Relay for camera, will switch from Camera 1 to "
"Camera 2."
msgstr "将分配给 Vsw 的继电器设为开/高电平将关闭该供电。同样，将摄像头对应继电器设为开/高电平将从摄像头 1 切换到摄像头 2。"

